            "text_4YQg8H": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Finding the right wetsuit size is the single most important step in getting the most out of your suit. A proper fit can make or break your time in the water — too loose and water will flush through, leaving you cold and uncomfortable, too tight and you’ll feel restricted.</p><p>Every brand’s sizing is a little different, so don’t rely on your “usual size.” Instead, follow the specific size chart for the wetsuit brand you’re looking at, and take your own measurements to be sure.</p><p><strong>Pro tip:</strong> if you’re between sizes, it’s usually better to size down for a snugger fit. Wetsuits are designed to stretch and contour to your body, and a closer fit will keep you warmer.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "rte",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
